          "text": "በት ፡ እኔ ፡ ምስክሩ ፡ ነኝ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምነ ፡ ሀገር ፡ ቅድስት ፡ ዘጽሑፍ ፡ ውስተ ፡ ዝንቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መጽሐፍ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚህ ፡ መጽሐፍ ፡ በተጻፈች ፡ በመንግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ከሚገኝ ፡ ክብር ፡ ዕድል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈንታውን ፡ ጽዋ ፡ ተራውን ፡ ይከፍልበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታል ፡ እንዲከፍልበት ፡ እኔ ፡ ምስክሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነኝ ፥ ዘዳግ ፡ ፬ ፥ ፪ና ፥ ፲፪ ፥ ፴፪ ። ፊል ፡ ፬ ፥ ፫ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳ ፤ ⟪—ወይበል ፡ ዘሰምዐ ፡ ዘንተ ፡ እወ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህን ፡ የሰማ ፡ አዎን ፡ ይከፍልበታል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አዎን ፡ ይጨምርበታል ፡ ይበል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እመጽእ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡ አሜን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈጥኜ ፡ እመጣለሁና ፡ (ይበል ፡ አሜን) ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሜን ፡ ይጨምርበት ፡ አሜን ፡ ይክፈል",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በት ፡ ይበል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ነዓ ፡ እግዚእየ ፡ ኢየሱስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እመጽእ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡ ቢለው ፡ የናፍቆት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አነጋገር ፡ ጌታዬ ፡ ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ና ፡ ይላል ። አንድም ፡ እመጽእ ፡ ፍጡነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ፡ ነበርና ፡ ይበል ፡ አሜን ፡ ጌታዬ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ይሁን ፡ ና ፡ ይላል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": "፳፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፳፩ ፤ ⟪ጸጋሁ ፡ ለእግዚእነ ፡ ኢሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምስለ ፡ ኵልክሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የጌታችን ፡ የኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ፡ ጸጋው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይደርባችሁ ፡ ይደረግላችሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አሜን ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይሁን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "colophon",
          "text": "⟪በዝየ ፡ ተፈጸመ ፡ ራእየ ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡ አቡቀለምሲስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "colophon",
          "text": "ዮሐንስ ፡ ያየው ፡ ራእይ ፡ ደረሰ ፥ ተፈጸመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
